# Game Account Rental — Pre-Migration Schema Proposal

Status: PROPOSAL ONLY. Belum diterapkan, belum divalidasi runtime.
Tidak ada perubahan pada `prisma/schema.prisma`, database, atau migrasi aktif.

## 1. Hasil verifikasi schema aktual (read-only)

- `User` (`id` String cuid): relasi `sessionTokens`, `passwordResetTokens`. Belum ada relasi ke `Session`.
- `Session` (`id` String cuid): field `endTime DateTime?`, `durationMinutes Int`, `remainingMinutes Int`, `hourlyRate Float`, `totalPrice Float`, `status SessionStatus` (ACTIVE/COMPLETED/CANCELLED), `paymentStatus PaymentStatus`, `transactionId String?`, `gameId String?`, `memberId String?`, `pcId String?`, `consoleId String?`. Relasi `game Game?` dengan `onDelete: SetNull`.
- `Game` (`id` String cuid): `title @unique`, `isActive Boolean`. Relasi `sessions Session[]` dan `memberStats`.
- Enum `Role`: ADMIN, OPERATOR, STAFF. Tidak ada enum rental.
- `Session.transactionId` menunjuk ke `Transaction`. Checkout sudah ada di `checkoutSession` (`src/services/session.service.ts`, ~baris 374).

